{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-09_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-09",
  "title": "自光輝中奔湧",
  "storyCode": "14-10",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "18a4ad9435ed9f20bba8ad2e18696e9055b3f46736435c499170282ca9ed99bc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g2_mainbattlefield"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有人，不許擅自更換前行路線。全速穿過“加斯特里爾”號的掩護炮擊區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掩護將軍返回本艦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "炮彈落在全速前行的機動部隊兩側。硝煙遮掩了他們的行蹤，炮火擊碎了兩側湧來的薩卡茲軍隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，前方兩百米處發現了那些食腐者的奇怪東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個王座散發的氣息……讓這些魔族佬補充缺口的速度更快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們在快速合攏……他們試圖攔截我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍，需不需要側翼護衛隊繼續分流——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_652_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍，我們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_652_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "碾過他們。咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1331_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（沉悶的呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "硝煙中，沉默的白袍們揚起了長劍，斬開了落向他們的炮火。\n他們消失在炸開的煙塵中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "準備接敵。五，四，三，二——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_652_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要讓我失望——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1331_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1331_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天空，墜下，火焰——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死亡亦有差異，薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "紫色的火焰圍住了威靈頓公爵的整支機動部隊，升騰的沖天火柱在戰場上隔離出了一片完全安全的空間——\n由死亡之火創造的，給予生機的空間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_652_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛布拉娜殿下，您的確值得信賴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而您與死亡爭鋒的風采同樣令我欽佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過您的傷勢很嚴重，食腐者的死亡氣息仍在侵蝕您的軀體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這身軍裝隱藏了您的傷勢，但還瞞不過我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_652_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扶住我的手，閣下，您不應再與這些顛簸的載具同行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "容我親自伴您回到“加斯特里爾”號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_652_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "區區小傷而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "跨過死亡的公爵無視了德拉克伸出的手，他扶著手杖的身軀依舊挺得筆直。\n疼痛？\n不過如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_652_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛布拉娜殿下，您的火焰還是灼人了些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_652_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓這堵火牆開一個口子吧，我會在前為您引路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_652_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下，放心，這支手杖隨我走上過更可怕的戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_652_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會站在“加斯特里爾”號的艦頭，等待維多利亞的求救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如您所願，我忠誠的閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倘若您的身體無法再負擔您的野心，我會用火焰重新點燃您的心臟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死亡也無法阻攔您進軍的腳步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們即塔拉。我們會站在這片土地上最耀眼的位置——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攜手焚盡整片戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g13_warshipcommandroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“警告，警告——”\n“艦體損傷程度超過百分之六十五，導航系統下線，推進系統下線……”\n“備用能源啟動。”\n“輪機室遭到破壞，源石燃料洩漏嚴重。”\n“兩點三十四分，「弗雷德里克」號被三枚巫術炮彈同時命中，推進系統癱瘓。”\n“交戰區巫術污染嚴重，負責支援的三艘護衛艦無法靠近，正在調遣步兵——”\n“第二防線遭遇猛烈衝擊！九營裝甲連正在阻擋食腐者步兵，布萊克中校和莫寧少校已經犧牲，目前由西摩上尉接替指揮。”\n“「精益」號發現一支食腐者術師隊伍靠近！「勇敢者」號失去聯絡，並未識別到具體座標……”\n“高多汀公爵所屬三艘無畏艦正在全速趕來支援，亞伯寇恩公爵和阿什沃思公爵的突擊艦戰鬥集群也已回應了支援請求！”\n“源石活性高到無法計數！那是什麼，是源石吃掉了我們的船嗎？！”\n……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閣下，變故很突然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活著的“灰禮帽”都已經全部散了出去，傳回的訊息都已匯總到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的人正在死去，食腐者正把整片戰場變成絞肉機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳……我們還剩下多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1337_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不足三分之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1337_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閣下……您應該撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1337_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的旗艦還保留了防守能力，就算在這種環境下，也能確保為您清出一條通路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾琳，將我留守“榮光”號的訊息傳遞出去，不管用什麼手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1337_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如我拋棄了前線，防線必然會徹底崩潰。勝利會進一步離維多利亞而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他士兵會怎麼看我們……又一個拋棄他們的大公爵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此戰結束之後，我們的士兵也需要記住，我為了勝利付出了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1337_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會繼續吸引食腐者的火力，其他公爵必然會趕來拱衛我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……現在的形勢，孰輕孰重，他們分得清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，我的精銳都在這裡，你們才是我的底氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必再說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閣下，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，以最快速度肅清我們這間艙室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的勝利會自這處堡壘開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閣下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，遵命。那我們必須拿到諸王之息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劍座仍在，並未損毀。這會成為我們反攻的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一直和我們那位維娜小姐聯繫的“灰禮帽”還活著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的通訊管道目前已經恢復。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好，聯繫他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有新的命令傳給他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g5_crackedhispdwarship"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……咳咳，典範軍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "機靈點，士兵，不要往敵人堆裡衝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼多血……礦石病。抑制劑……唉，早就用光了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你先忍一下，別亂動，否則源石結晶很可能會刺穿你的肺部……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無所謂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生……長官。我們的人差不多死光了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克拉克是倒數第二個。對，就你腳邊的那隻手，那是他僅剩的部分了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還能幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕特爾。理查·帕特爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕特爾列兵，看你的徽標，你隸屬於九營裝甲連，你的最高一級指揮官是布萊克中校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒記錯的話，你們連的任務是護衛開斯特公爵的旗艦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是誰？哪個部隊的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戴菲恩，隸屬於典範軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和你一樣……我恨這些敵人。他們奪走了我的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我還記得自己的任務。我是來支援你們的，帕特爾列兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "支援我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "溫德米爾公爵死了，我們尊敬的公爵閣下不知道還在不在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有鐵公爵……那該死的老威靈頓，他甚至臨陣脫逃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們還來幹什麼？我們還有什麼勝利的希望？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "戴菲恩下意識看了眼不遠處的維娜，還有她背上的諸王之息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……就算大公爵放棄了，我們也絕不放棄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絕不放棄……是嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他……快死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，趕快散開！他隨時都有可能崩解，我們來不及處理他了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "戴菲恩看到了士兵眼中的血絲……還有決意與渴求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽好了，典範軍，前面有一支食腐者的隊伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把我……放進那邊的戰車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，戴菲恩小姐！不要靠近他，交給我處理——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕特爾列兵，我會幫你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果……這是你最後的心願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "破破爛爛的戰車衝向薩卡茲的軍陣。\n很多典範軍並沒有意識到發生了什麼。直到，所有人都聽見了……一個普通士兵用生命發出的最後呐喊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會記下你們的功勛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開斯特公爵麾下九營裝甲連的每位軍人，都是願意以死護衛“榮光”號，護衛維多利亞的好軍人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……等一下，那是什麼動靜，死人站了起來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是死人在動。是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是枯枝。\n枝條從倒下的食腐者戰士的身體裡抽了出來，不斷地向四處延伸，鑽回腐敗氣息最為濃重的霧氣中。\n一道身影自霧中爬起，迅速地靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戴菲恩，後退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1331_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（沉悶的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶……還好，我也沒那麼容易死掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這裡倒下的話，我們的生命會被食腐者的祭壇汲取，淪為他們的養料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，帕特爾列兵的心願落空了？就連死亡都無法擊敗的敵人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，戴菲恩小姐。他確實殺死了這一支食腐者小隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只不過——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個怪物顯然還在汲取死亡，並非全盛狀態，抓住機會消滅目標！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我掩護你們！風笛，側翼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕特爾列兵的心願不會落空。我們會從他打開的缺口衝出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位，動手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能猶豫，拖下去，情況可能更麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼還站著不動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……不會是在這個時候退縮了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "退縮？不，我只會忠於職責暫時撤離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亞歷山德莉娜殿下，不必如此瞪著我，的確正事要緊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的閣下剛剛向我傳達了她最新的指令——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交易取消。您得帶著諸王之息撤離，等候她後續的指令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們不可能走到劍座，這把“鑰匙”也絕不能落入薩卡茲的手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如有必要，可動用“一切特殊手段”確保諸王之息的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我對此毫不意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們不用如此警惕地看著我，公爵閣下的命令我並無任何隱瞞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你們不會放棄前往劍座，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得算我一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的最高優先級職責，依舊是確保公爵閣下的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，畢竟這時候，我上哪去找比典範軍更值得信任的盟友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的公爵不會喜歡這個判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已經充分交換了意見，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰讓我寡不敵眾，拿你們沒有一點辦法呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去吧，殿下，你最好有一個完整的計劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心。不用親愛的姑姑操心……我知道該怎麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "維娜的計劃從來都不複雜，但在這片混亂的戰場上，卻意外好用。\n典範軍的所有人都清楚他們在為何而戰。\n無論戰火將他們衝散到何處，最終，活下來的人都會在勝利的終點相聚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g5_crackedhispdwarship"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還能走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "典範軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……不行……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就趴到我背上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我把你搬到安全……沒有什麼安全的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就那塊被炸下來的船舷後面吧。你稍微躲躲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "典範軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別管我們了……嘶，眼下最重要的就是諸王之息！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別傻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諸王之息的事情，維娜那支小隊心裡有數。我們的任務只是牽制敵人和分擔火力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少尉，這邊需要醫療援助！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲茲，你家在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "典範軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……東漢姆。呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "東漢姆的皮革很不錯，我去過那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "腿部有開放式創口，可見刺傷。先緊急止血，除了傷口外還有哪裡疼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "典範軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，我只是……只是有點累……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有惦記的人嗎，菲茲？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "典範軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴里……對街的……他還欠我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說出來，在心裡默念，不斷給我重複默念！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後活著回去親口告訴他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "意識清醒，沒有骨折，沒有內臟出血和急性感染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，傷口暫時清理完畢。在包紮完成後我會給他一些消炎藥，在休息一段時間後他會沒事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹得不錯，戴菲恩小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少尉，你想回到我們的船被突襲的那一天嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1070_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……要是能贏的話，我想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我的錯誤，我的無能……我們輸給了當時那些薩卡茲，輸得很慘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天，我不想再輸一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少尉，帶菲茲往後撤，這裡還需要我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這掩體撐不住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下一處掩體的位置呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個帽子怪人已經找到了，注意看他的訊號！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些士兵，是開斯特的守軍！我們已經很接近了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火力在減弱！戴菲恩他們成功吸引了很大一部分火力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我已經能清楚地看到劍座——\n趴下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等！這不是薩卡茲的攻擊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是“榮光”號，隊長！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“榮光”號注意到我們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它的艦炮也在為我們開闢道路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓住這個機會，推進！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "向著風暴中心去，向著炮火聚焦處去，向著敵人的陣中去。\n錘子敲進骨頭，劍鋒割開血肉。\n身邊人的傷勢越來越重，她們都已不再費力清理滿是血污的臉。\n可她們依舊在前進。即使艱難，也還是在前進。\n“榮光”號就在眼前，維娜已經能聽到上方傳來的戰鬥嘶吼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "堅持住，馬上可以突入“榮光”號——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“（含糊不清的薩卡茲語）不允……”\n“（含糊不清的薩卡茲語）……通行。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“維娜！”\n“諸王之息！諸王之息被打飛了！找到——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“（含糊不清的薩卡茲語）死……”\n“（含糊不清的薩卡茲語）……終點。”\n“該死！維娜，站起來！”\n“救她！風笛，護住我背後，我正在裝填彈藥！”\n“我能擋住他們的劍！他媽的怎麼不能再跑快點！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“維娜！！！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“維多利亞……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“維多利亞！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“維多利亞！！”\n維娜忘不掉這個聲音，哪怕她已經分辨不清聲音中蘊含的所有訊息。\n但她的直覺告訴她，那是一個名字，一個與她一生聯繫在一起的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "地面碎裂，一同裂開的還有三座移動祭壇。\n白色水汽蒸騰，火紅焰刃浮現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快看，蒸汽騎士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蒸汽騎士在我們的身邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維多利亞的榮光回來了，他和我們在一起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟上去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殺啊，一起把薩卡茲都殺光！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "榮光歸於——維多利亞！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g5_crackedhispdwarship"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查爾斯·林奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_651_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（沉悶的噴氣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "砍，穿刺，衝鋒。\n甲胄沉默而瘋狂地戰鬥著。\n他行進的路線上，很快堆滿了薩卡茲的屍體，以及祭壇的碎片。\n巫術飛彈落在他腳下，弩箭射向他，長刀砍向他。\n他一刻未停——帶著敵人留下的痕跡甚至敵人本身，砍向下一個敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蒸汽騎士……還活著？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我們在城內遭遇過他一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他……為什麼出現在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他為了那把劍……而來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我……能撐住！\n但劍……不見了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到諸王之息了！在交戰區的屍體堆裡，我會替你取回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "照你自己說的，繼續走，別回頭，時機不能耽誤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我保證，那柄劍，會在需要的時候出現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會繼續走。掩護我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她握緊了手中的錘，已經不再遲疑。\n不僅是伙伴，她同樣將信任交付給了從不信任的人……不，她將信任交付給了維多利亞。\n那個她所相信的維多利亞。\n跑起來。再快一點。就快到了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別硬撐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再挨一下，你的命就沒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "移動祭壇……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——停下了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開炮的是——我們維多利亞的戰車？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，我們正和法夫公爵的裝甲連在一起！我們找到了西摩上尉，他還活著！更多部隊正在靠近與我們會合！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些飛來飛去的祭壇交給我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好樣的！我們繼續前進！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們別他媽的想擋我們的路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有的彈藥都傾瀉完了，接下來……就是肉搏戰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收到，隊長！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真懷念，就像我們還在學院的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就讓這些薩卡茲試試看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "試試看……越過我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劍座就在前面，那些腐敗的霧氣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下，我的同僚守住了“榮光”號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳……下次有必要合作的時候，典範軍一定會與這頂禮帽再度相見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後，讓我用源石技藝……和一點點權限，給你們照個明吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "濃重的腐敗之霧被一點綠光切開了。\n風暴深處，劍座正在發亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，那把劍……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想來想去，都覺得，公爵閣下的命令，總是不該違抗的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我也答應了殿下你，真是難辦啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，接住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一道銀色的光芒劃過了戰場，穿透迷霧。\n諸王之息。它平凡到沒有引起混戰雙方士兵的注意——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我接住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推進之王，別回頭，就剩最後一段路了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長，不用管我，追上她們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "風暴從戰場上揚起，白狼已經一躍而起。\n瞄準，發射。她已熟稔於心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推進之王，接住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那柄長劍被她擲出，掠過了越來越多雙抬頭仰望的眼睛。\n維娜沒有回頭，她奔跑著，仔細聆聽著每一絲聲音。\n“嗡”。\n金屬在空氣中振動的聲音，空氣被銳器切破的聲音。\n她重重扔出手中的錘子。巨錘嵌入崖壁，為她創造出一絲立足之地……\n踩踏，跳躍。當她伸出手時，她已握住了諸王之息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因陀羅，摩根，還記得我們是怎麼把燃燒瓶扔進貴族煙囪裡去的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站到我們肩膀上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，這一次，我先跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "腳下的源石是活著的，不同於她越過的任何一面牆、一座山。\n還有多遠？\n距離雲霧散開，戰爭停息還有多遠？\n她從倫蒂尼姆逃到外面，又從外面回到倫蒂尼姆。回到安心的家園，回到所愛之人身邊的路……到底還要走多遠？\n維娜不知道。可至少，劍座就在眼前。她竭盡全力拔出錘子。\n維娜知道自己該怎麼做。\n她已躍起，手中高舉的劍與錘在陽光下閃耀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
